  "has_voiceover": false,
  "description": "Market Thoughts, Cutting a Position and One I am Watching",
  "body_html": "<p>Just some general thoughts about the market. As many of you know, I have fought through the incessant negative headlines, and remain steadfast on the blow off top. The final leg of this multi-year bull market. Its been a wonderful few years, and I think we still have more upwards trajectory ahead of us. We continue to…somewhat randomly…keep making all time highs. </p><p>In this video, I discuss a few topics. For example, Apple, though its been a splendid stock for decades…don’t get yourself caught in a “GE” situation, where you are Dollar Cost Averaging a popular stock for 22 years, only to break even in 25 years. I know commentary like this is not “popular”…but its the truth. Just because a stock always has, does not mean it always will. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>I did cut 1 position today, it is discussed in this video and down below. I am also keeping an eye on another position that is being fussy. Compound winners, cut losers.</p><p>Please do not feel the need to subscribe for the content down below, this is a positional update for people following along with me already.  </p>",
